    _definition
; PLEASE GIVE A SEMI-FORMAL HUMAN-READABLE DESCRIPTION HERE.

  For example, '2s2p' for B-F or '6s6p7s5f' for actinides.
;
    loop_ _example
          _example_detail
          2s2p      'for B-F'
          6s6p7s5f  'for actinides'

